{"__formatVersion":2,"__revision":"3da976f23bfb0399","__entryId":"popconfirm","entry":{"sceneUI":["<div class=\"popconfirm-scene\">\n      <div style=\"align-self:flex-end;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;margin-right:30px\">\n        <div class=\"popconfirm-card\"><div class=\"popconfirm-text\"><i>⚠</i><span>确认删除这条记录？</span></div><div class=\"popconfirm-actions\"><span class=\"btn btn-outline\">取消</span><span class=\"btn btn-danger\">删除</span></div></div>\n        <div class=\"popconfirm-arrow\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"width:100%;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px\">\n        <span style=\"flex:1;font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">📄 首页改版.fig</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">2 小时前</span>\n        <span class=\"btn btn-text\" style=\"color:var(--red)\">删除</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div class=\"popconfirm-scene\">\n      <div style=\"align-self:flex-end;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;margin-right:24px\">\n        <div class=\"popconfirm-card\"><div class=\"popconfirm-text\"><span>确认移出成员「林小hu」？</span></div><div class=\"popconfirm-actions\"><span class=\"btn btn-outline\">取消</span><span class=\"btn btn-primary\">确定</span></div></div>\n        <div class=\"popconfirm-arrow\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"width:100%;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px\">\n        <img src=\"/assets/avatar-fox.png\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%\" alt=\"\">\n        <span style=\"flex:1;font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">林小hu · 产品经理</span>\n        <span class=\"btn btn-text\" style=\"color:var(--red)\">移出</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div class=\"popconfirm-scene\">\n      <div style=\"align-self:flex-end;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;margin-right:30px\">\n        <div class=\"popconfirm-card\"><div class=\"popconfirm-text\"><i>⚠</i><span>清空全部输入？</span></div><div class=\"popconfirm-actions\"><span class=\"btn btn-outline\">取消</span><span class=\"btn btn-danger\">清空</span></div></div>\n        <div class=\"popconfirm-arrow\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"width:100%;display:flex;gap:8px\">\n        <input class=\"demo-input\" style=\"flex:1;min-width:0\" value=\"林小hu · lin@vibe.guide\">\n        <span class=\"btn btn-outline\">清空</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div class=\"popconfirm-scene\">\n      <div style=\"align-self:flex-end;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;margin-right:16px\">\n        <div class=\"popconfirm-card\"><div class=\"popconfirm-text\"><span>确认取消发布？文章将转为草稿。</span></div><div class=\"popconfirm-actions\"><span class=\"btn btn-outline\">取消</span><span class=\"btn btn-primary\">确定</span></div></div>\n        <div class=\"popconfirm-arrow\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"width:100%;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px\">\n        <span style=\"flex:1;font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">📝 夏季活动方案</span>\n        <span class=\"demo-tag green\">已发布</span>\n        <span class=\"btn btn-text\">取消发布</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"sceneUI_en":["<div class=\"popconfirm-scene\">\n      <div style=\"align-self:flex-end;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;margin-right:30px\">\n        <div class=\"popconfirm-card\"><div class=\"popconfirm-text\"><i>⚠</i><span>Delete this record? </span></div><div class=\"popconfirm-actions\"><span class=\"btn btn-outline\">Cancel</span><span class=\"btn btn-danger\">Delete</span></div></div>\n        <div class=\"popconfirm-arrow\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"width:100%;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px\">\n        <span style=\"flex:1;font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">📄 Home page revision.fig</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">2 hours ago</span>\n        <span class=\"btn btn-text\" style=\"color:var(--red)\">Delete</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div class=\"popconfirm-scene\">\n      <div style=\"align-self:flex-end;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;margin-right:24px\">\n        <div class=\"popconfirm-card\"><div class=\"popconfirm-text\"><span>Remove Alex Chen from the team? </span></div><div class=\"popconfirm-actions\"><span class=\"btn btn-outline\">Cancel</span><span class=\"btn btn-primary\">Confirm</span></div></div>\n        <div class=\"popconfirm-arrow\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"width:100%;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px\">\n        <img src=\"/assets/avatar-fox.png\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%\" alt=\"\">\n        <span style=\"flex:1;font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">Alex Chen · Product Manager</span>\n        <span class=\"btn btn-text\" style=\"color:var(--red)\">Remove</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div class=\"popconfirm-scene\">\n      <div style=\"align-self:flex-end;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;margin-right:30px\">\n        <div class=\"popconfirm-card\"><div class=\"popconfirm-text\"><i>⚠</i><span>Clear all inputs? </span></div><div class=\"popconfirm-actions\"><span class=\"btn btn-outline\">Cancel</span><span class=\"btn btn-danger\">Clear</span></div></div>\n        <div class=\"popconfirm-arrow\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"width:100%;display:flex;gap:8px\">\n        <input class=\"demo-input\" style=\"flex:1;min-width:0\" value=\"Alex Chen · lin@vibe.guide\">\n        <span class=\"btn btn-outline\">Clear</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div class=\"popconfirm-scene\">\n      <div style=\"align-self:flex-end;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;margin-right:16px\">\n        <div class=\"popconfirm-card\"><div class=\"popconfirm-text\"><span>Unpublish this article? It will return to draft status. </span></div><div class=\"popconfirm-actions\"><span class=\"btn btn-outline\">Cancel</span><span class=\"btn btn-primary\">Confirm</span></div></div>\n        <div class=\"popconfirm-arrow\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"width:100%;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px\">\n        <span style=\"flex:1;font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">📝 Summer Activity Plan</span>\n        <span class=\"demo-tag green\">Published</span>\n        <span class=\"btn btn-text\">Unpublish</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"anatomy":{"demo":"<div class=\"popconfirm-anat\"><div class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"card\"><div class=\"popconfirm-card\"><div class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"text\"><div class=\"popconfirm-text\"><i>⚠</i><span>确认删除这条记录？</span></div></div><div class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"actions\"><div class=\"popconfirm-actions\"><span class=\"btn btn-outline\">取消</span><span class=\"btn btn-primary\">确定</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"popconfirm-arrow\"></div><div class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"trigger\"><span class=\"btn btn-danger\">删除</span></div></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"popconfirm-anat\"><div class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"card\"><div class=\"popconfirm-card\"><div class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"text\"><div class=\"popconfirm-text\"><i>⚠</i><span>Delete this record? </span></div></div><div class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"actions\"><div class=\"popconfirm-actions\"><span class=\"btn btn-outline\">Cancel</span><span class=\"btn btn-primary\">Confirm</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"popconfirm-arrow\"></div><div class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"trigger\"><span class=\"btn btn-danger\">Delete</span></div></div>","parts":[{"key":"card","cn":"气泡框","en":"Bubble","desc":"挂在触发按钮旁边的小卡片，不遮罩","desc_en":"A small, unmasked card positioned beside its trigger button"},{"key":"text","cn":"确认文案","en":"Message","desc":"一句话问清，常配 ⚠ 图标","desc_en":"Use a one-sentence question, often paired with a ⚠ icon"},{"key":"actions","cn":"操作按钮","en":"Actions","desc":"确定 / 取消，确定可以说清后果","desc_en":"Offer Confirm and Cancel; make the confirmation label describe the consequence"},{"key":"trigger","cn":"触发按钮","en":"Trigger","desc":"点击才弹出，气泡始终指着它","desc_en":"It opens on click, and its arrow points to the trigger."}]},"variants":[{"cn":"默认确认","en":"Default","demo":"<div class=\"popconfirm-demo\"><div class=\"popconfirm-card\"><div class=\"popconfirm-text\"><span>确认移出该成员？</span></div><div class=\"popconfirm-actions\"><span class=\"btn btn-outline\">取消</span><span class=\"btn btn-primary\">确定</span></div></div><div class=\"popconfirm-arrow\"></div><span class=\"btn btn-text\">移出</span></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"popconfirm-demo\"><div class=\"popconfirm-card\"><div class=\"popconfirm-text\"><span>Remove this member from the team? </span></div><div class=\"popconfirm-actions\"><span class=\"btn btn-outline\">Cancel</span><span class=\"btn btn-primary\">Confirm</span></div></div><div class=\"popconfirm-arrow\"></div><span class=\"btn btn-text\">Remove</span></div>","when":"后果可恢复的轻量操作防误点，如移出成员","when_en":"For lightweight, recoverable actions where confirmation can prevent mistakes, such as removing a member"},{"cn":"警示确认","en":"Warning","demo":"<div class=\"popconfirm-demo\"><div class=\"popconfirm-card\"><div class=\"popconfirm-text\"><i>⚠</i><span>清空全部输入？</span></div><div class=\"popconfirm-actions\"><span class=\"btn btn-outline\">取消</span><span class=\"btn btn-primary\">清空</span></div></div><div class=\"popconfirm-arrow\"></div><span class=\"btn btn-outline\">清空</span></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"popconfirm-demo\"><div class=\"popconfirm-card\"><div class=\"popconfirm-text\"><i>⚠</i><span>Clear all inputs? </span></div><div class=\"popconfirm-actions\"><span class=\"btn btn-outline\">Cancel</span><span class=\"btn btn-primary\">Clear</span></div></div><div class=\"popconfirm-arrow\"></div><span class=\"btn btn-outline\">Clear</span></div>","when":"清空已填写内容等存在误操作风险时","when_en":"When an action could accidentally clear entered content"},{"cn":"危险确认","en":"Danger","demo":"<div class=\"popconfirm-demo\"><div class=\"popconfirm-card\"><div class=\"popconfirm-text\"><i>⚠</i><span>确认删除这条记录？</span></div><div class=\"popconfirm-actions\"><span class=\"btn btn-outline\">取消</span><span class=\"btn btn-danger\">删除</span></div></div><div class=\"popconfirm-arrow\"></div><span class=\"btn btn-danger\">删除</span></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"popconfirm-demo\"><div class=\"popconfirm-card\"><div class=\"popconfirm-text\"><i>⚠</i><span>Delete this record? </span></div><div class=\"popconfirm-actions\"><span class=\"btn btn-outline\">Cancel</span><span class=\"btn btn-danger\">Delete</span></div></div><div class=\"popconfirm-arrow\"></div><span class=\"btn btn-danger\">Delete</span></div>","when":"删除类操作，确认按钮标红强调后果","when_en":"For deletion, use a red confirmation button to emphasize the consequence"}],"use":[{"t":"<b>可恢复的轻量操作</b>：误点会麻烦，但后果容易撤销","m":"popconfirm-delete"},{"t":"<b>列表行内操作</b>：在当前上下文中完成确认","m":"popconfirm-inline"},{"t":"<b>移出成员 / 取消关注</b>：可逆的小动作","m":"popconfirm-leave"},{"t":"<b>清空输入</b>：避免误清除已填写内容","m":"popconfirm-clear"}],"dont":[{"t":"不可逆的高风险操作：使用 {c:modal} 提供完整确认","m":"popconfirm-danger","bad":true},{"t":"说明文字较长：使用 {c:modal} 承载完整内容","m":"popconfirm-long","bad":true},{"t":"只需展示信息：使用 {c:popover} 或 {c:tooltip}","m":"popconfirm-as-tip","bad":true},{"t":"连续要求多次确认：应改进触发条件或操作流程","m":"popconfirm-chain","bad":true}],"lessonPractice":{"title":"项目归档后会立刻从团队视图消失，恢复还要进入归档列表。怎样确认更合适？","options":[{"id":"nearby-confirm","label":"在“归档”旁边就近说明影响，并提供确认和取消","feedback":"对。单个、可逆但有后果的即时动作适合就近确认。","correct":true},{"id":"full-modal","label":"打开完整弹窗，重新展示项目详情和所有归档设置","feedback":"完整弹窗会让一个简单的就近判断变得过重。","correct":false},{"id":"no-confirm","label":"第一次点击就直接归档，只显示“操作成功”","feedback":"可恢复不等于没有影响；用户仍需要在执行前确认对象和结果。","correct":false}],"en":{"title":"Archiving a project removes it from the team view immediately, and restoring it requires the archive list. What confirmation fits?","options":[{"id":"nearby-confirm","label":"Use a Popconfirm near the trigger, explaining impact with Archive and Cancel","feedback":"Correct. A single, reversible but consequential immediate action fits nearby confirmation.","correct":true},{"id":"full-modal","label":"Open a full Modal with many settings for every archive","feedback":"A full dialog makes a simple nearby decision unnecessarily heavy.","correct":false},{"id":"no-confirm","label":"Skip confirmation because it can be restored","feedback":"Reversible does not mean consequence-free; people still need to confirm the target and result.","correct":false}]}},"lessonAgentPrompt":{"title":"你可以这样告诉 AI Agent","text":"项目归档请使用靠近触发按钮的 Popconfirm，明确写出项目名和“团队将不再默认看到它”，并提供取消。分别取消一次和确认一次，确认取消不改变数据、确认后列表状态更新且可恢复。","en":{"title":"You can say this to an AI Agent","text":"Use a Popconfirm beside project Archive. Name the project and state that the team will no longer see it by default, with Cancel. Test cancel and confirm: cancel must not change data; confirm must update the list and leave a recovery path."}},"scenes":["删除列表行","移出成员","清空表单","取消发布"],"en":{"use":[{"t":"Remove one item","m":"popconfirm-delete"},{"t":"Discard a small local change","m":"popconfirm-inline"},{"t":"Confirm a reversible table action","m":"popconfirm-leave"},{"t":"Ask a short yes-or-no question in context","m":"popconfirm-clear"}],"dont":[{"t":"Confirm a high-risk action with too little explanation","m":"popconfirm-danger","bad":true},{"t":"Use it for a form or several decisions","m":"popconfirm-long","bad":true},{"t":"Place it where the triggering control may move away","m":"popconfirm-as-tip","bad":true},{"t":"Ask for confirmation on harmless, easily reversible actions","m":"popconfirm-chain","bad":true}],"scenes":["Remove tag","Delete row","Discard draft","Leave a group"],"sceneUI":[