\n        <div class=\"popconfirm-card\"><div class=\"popconfirm-text\"><i>⚠</i><span>Clear all inputs? </span></div><div class=\"popconfirm-actions\"><span class=\"btn btn-outline\">Cancel</span><span class=\"btn btn-danger\">Clear</span></div></div>\n        <div class=\"popconfirm-arrow\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"width:100%;display:flex;gap:8px\">\n        <input class=\"demo-input\" style=\"flex:1;min-width:0\" value=\"Alex Chen · lin@vibe.guide\">\n        <span class=\"btn btn-outline\">Clear</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div class=\"popconfirm-scene\">\n      <div style=\"align-self:flex-end;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;margin-right:16px\">\n        <div class=\"popconfirm-card\"><div class=\"popconfirm-text\"><span>Unpublish this article? It will return to draft status. </span></div><div class=\"popconfirm-actions\"><span class=\"btn btn-outline\">Cancel</span><span class=\"btn btn-primary\">Confirm</span></div></div>\n        <div class=\"popconfirm-arrow\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"width:100%;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px\">\n        <span style=\"flex:1;font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">📝 Summer Activity Plan</span>\n        <span class=\"demo-tag green\">Published</span>\n        <span class=\"btn btn-text\">Unpublish</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"variants":[{"demo":"<div class=\"popconfirm-demo\"><div class=\"popconfirm-card\"><div class=\"popconfirm-text\"><span>Remove this member from the team? </span></div><div class=\"popconfirm-actions\"><span class=\"btn btn-outline\">Cancel</span><span class=\"btn btn-primary\">Confirm</span></div></div><div class=\"popconfirm-arrow\"></div><span class=\"btn btn-text\">Remove</span></div>","when":"For lightweight, recoverable actions where confirmation can prevent mistakes, such as removing a member"},{"demo":"<div class=\"popconfirm-demo\"><div clas